      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "We prove an explicit formula conjectured recently by Wang and Levin for the anomaly of time-reversal symmetry in (2+1)-dimensional fermionic topological quantum field theories. The crucial step is to determine the cross-cap state in terms of the modular S matrix and T^{2} eigenvalues, generalizing the recent analysis by Barkeshli et al. in the bosonic case."},
